  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Black Spear Task Force",
    "summary": "Each friendly **KILL TEAM** unit that has this ability gains 3 abilities, each working while the named doctrine is active for it:\n\n- **Furor Tactics** (**devastator doctrine**): its attacks gain **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Malleus Tactics** (**tactical doctrine**): its attacks gain **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Purgatus Tactics** (**assault doctrine**): its attacks targeting enemy units up to 9\" away from it gain **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)**.\n\nArmy restrictions:\n\n- You may include **ADEPTUS ASTARTES DEATHWATCH** units; **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter are not allowed.\n- No **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM DEATHWATCH** units may be included, except **KILL TEAM CASSIUS** (see Legends: Agents of the Imperium).",
